<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE II</span>: </span><span id="S5.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Simulation Experimental Results on the RoboTwin 2.0 Benchmark.<span id="S5.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Comparison of success rates across eight tasks, along with the overall average performance.
“†” indicates our reproduced results. Bold indicates the highest score.</span></span></figcaption>
