<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T4.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE IV</span>: </span><span id="S5.T4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Efficiency Comparison Results.<span id="S5.T4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="S5.T4.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Latency</span> denotes inference delay; <span id="S5.T4.8.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Throughput</span> denotes the number of predicted actions per second; <span id="S5.T4.8.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Cost</span> is training time per 10k steps. “†” denotes results reproduced under identical settings as <math id="S5.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>VLA. All results are reported on A800 GPUs for a fair comparison.</span></span></figcaption>
